      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- View list of coding problems\n- View a given problems and code a solution is multiple languages\n- Submit their solution and get instant feedback.\n- View live leader board for competitions\n\n----- Out of Scope -----\n- auth & profile\n- payment\n- analytics\n- social features",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- View list of coding problems\n- View a given problems and code a solution is multiple languages\n- Submit their solution and get instant feedback.\n- View live leader board for competitions\n\n----- Out of Scope -----\n- auth & profile\n- payment\n- analytics\n- social features",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FREkUKjCWZRCXvutIqE_T",
