      "updated": 1783827753764,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional Requirements\n- Availability >> consistency\n- Isolation & security when running user code\n- Low latency - return submission results < 5 seconds\n- Scale to support competitions with 100k users\n\n----------- Out of Scope ---------\n- fault tolerant\n- secure purchases\n- CI/CD pipelines\n- backups",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional Requirements\n- Availability >> consistency\n- Isolation & security when running user code\n- Low latency - return submission results < 5 seconds\n- Scale to support competitions with 100k users\n\n----------- Out of Scope ---------\n- fault tolerant\n- secure purchases\n- CI/CD pipelines\n- backups",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
